<title>USA: Jacksonville, Fla., deal yields 5.55 pct in 2009.</title>
<headline>Jacksonville, Fla., deal yields 5.55 pct in 2009.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
